xq0AjcatAI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174539905293357056870963.jpeg/kgMa_EQpnHQLsWPoH-ZDn31vWMGcDKIHtilmvLYpZrw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174539896065363968537940.jpeg/wqfYdxF9xPyDUYwCETxxCpAgLa03Rmf64SC9euEgvXo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174539898464636928735298.jpeg/zetB1JWXUhoHLSP0Y_MXX2VGW27o984i-pnuhvqZ7oY\"/><p>01：59＞7.6吋Super XDR屏幕、比iPhone 18 Pro Max更大50％；外屏為5.4吋；對應Apple Pencil使用；Touch ID在機身邊；亦可利用Apple Watch為iPhone Duo解鎖；兩款顏色選擇，包括黑及白；機身更一般鈦金屬更硬倍、IP68</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538787724988416761439.jpeg/cjQePRAAjsz-pdzkjpU9TskZHU0HSZqbdkUbbHZFG2w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538785397018624924501.jpeg/BQJb-fH8p2m0p1IlYHxviDi2NqgZJtITeH3mT3h95k8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538783064854528789023.jpeg/lsIa1FAKZHUqqTyYMCrULARwA1IeuuT2-oV5ofqFeaE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538792137658368436185.jpeg/yxJBbNStDeU3gFOBF0XqOnyiWgPV0_hB49G5U-PRuVM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538789822271488801325.jpeg/5gt33GUWzIRL6ffdzTYUm_jGDn4uJ-9FysdZEMrHWRA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538787762737152941803.jpeg/R9AgJaNMs5GEPRUr-2xjGpOWIOwf1XJ82ODhQ9jg4UM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538785514459136421965.jpeg/u6CQwu1oxO0piaIdZE3_LK_Mb5z2SExhPyav6T8mr-k\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538783232626688315209.jpeg/ocrtMolRpQQu0ntBaoNFjwPQs0dBxTdPstvvGLLb7xg\"/><p>01：57＞隱藏式自拍鏡頭，幾乎沒有摺痕、機身十分輕薄、全新UI</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538030636077056410792.jpeg/k7IlnVD2PTNy8B5qyde0JqgidWTePKYvSnRuDkp0bg4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174538033131819008410258.jpeg/Uec9ZfBYP2SJAi0bmbcD3BW-b-DrRW_ADe-UwA3vlMA\"/><img